  "sourceFacts": {
    "horizontalBasis": "Retained exact-QID way27715355 and six current unscaled map controls. Western three-door facade, northwest bell and eastern apses sign the frame.",
    "architecturalHeights": "Retained exact-QID OSMway27715355/Q1568660 matches current main35184399804187. Six unscaled main/part/tower controls retain every raw tag and missing min_height. Main11m and northwest bell14m are current map heights; the retained main describes3building levels with no measured height. Both central square and round controls are tagged17m and share the modeled drum-top datum rather than being stacked as two17m solids. Low roofs,8.8m central apse,5.7m side apses, body/drum divisions, bell openings and dome/cross above17m are picture-led estimates; no surveyed dimensions claimed."
